.TH GENERATE4README 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
generate4readme \- public wrapper for generating README/reference material
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B generate4readme
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B generate4readme
runs the native README/reference generator. It is a public convenience wrapper around generate\-readme\-native and is primarily used when regenerating project documentation from native data.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1), generate_html(1)
